Z||000006||DaRkLoRD||06-09-2001||01:13 AM||||Well, based on my experiences in the last few years, I can tell you exactly what NOT to do when talking to girls... then you can do the exact opposite..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>seriously though, sometimes I think I'm socially defective...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||8
