Z||000019||Eric||06-13-2001||10:19 PM||||Isn't it funny that if you read a bunch of posts saying the same thing, you assume that it's a different person posting each post?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Okay Ken, I'll take a look at that book.  I've heard a lot of good things about it in the past.  I would tell myself, "I have to read that".  But so far, I haven't got around to it.  Just until I'm able get to the library, are there any good tidbits of wisdom you're willing to share that would help me out in my current situation?<P>I talked to her today, and I was able to 'trick' her into doing something with me next week.  Well, okay, she agreed to go bicycling with me, but that's a start, right?  I just don't want her to get the impression that I just want to be her buddy.||||reg||1
